  "summary": [
    "Pre-search check outcomes: no rebuild needed, rebuild needed, or undeterminable",
    "User two-way choice between rebuilding before search and searching the existing version",
    "Rebuild scale counts and detail file written under .temp/doc-link/query-docs",
    "Target-specification file passed to rebuild via --target-file",
    "Undeterminable result stops the search and reports the cause",
    "Search result contract: document ID, recorded path, reason, ToC version, freshness",
    "Read-only search AI reads every entry of the ToC copy and prioritizes recall",
    "Contents of the ToC copy given to the search AI, excluding paths and hashes",
    "resolve-dlid resolves document and section DLIDs from recorded state and recorded paths",
    "Resolution outcomes: resolved with content hash, not at recorded path, no record"
  ],
